[[0,507894,0,29,5,24,"2015-09-13T22:22:03","moshi","[e]",[],"<p>And more specifically, is there anything I can share with someone I know who I fear is becoming an SJW and who isn't yet open-minded enough to consider other ideas? Articles, videos, anything.</p>\n<p>I'm not trying to say that all SJWs are bad, but I think someone I know would go &quot;too far&quot; with it. I'm not quite sure how to say it... the &quot;bad&quot; kind of SJW? The one that the average voat user seems to hate.</p>\n<p>and p.s. I'm sorry, I know, I'm sick of reading about SJWs too, but I'm just looking for some inspiration or advice to deal with this issue in the real world. I'm not here to cause trouble. </p>","Ex-SJWs, what made you leave that crowd?","","AskVoat"],[1,2414259,0,8,0,8,"2015-09-13T22:24:13","G4","",[],"<p>Do SJWs identify as SJWs?</p>"],[2,2414302,2414259,1,0,1,"2015-09-13T22:28:13","moshi","",[],"<p>I'd say probably not until after they stop being an SJW. If that makes sense.</p>"],[2,2417876,2414259,2,0,2,"2015-09-14T02:30:07","sodalis","",[],"<p>I know a few people that identify themselves that way. Before it became a sarcastic slur it was their own self description.</p>"],[2,2433631,2414259,0,0,0,"2015-09-15T01:48:17","cynoclast","",[],"<p>Usually.</p>"],[1,2414563,0,7,0,7,"2015-09-13T22:50:19","Spotddawg","",[],"<p>SJWs</p>"],[2,2414650,2414563,2,0,2,"2015-09-13T22:56:49","moshi","",[],"<p>That's a pretty fair answer, but... what made you realize that SJWs weren't a good group of people?</p>\n<p>I mean, the answer seems obvious, but was there an &quot;a-ha&quot; moment when you first realized it? And what caused that a-ha moment? Censorship in action? A poor argument?</p>"],[3,2414693,2414650,6,2,4,"2015-09-13T22:59:49","Spotddawg","",[],"<p>Working a real job after college, I experiences and working with diversity hires and having to pick up their slack and there's nothing management can do. </p>"],[4,2414705,2414693,1,0,1,"2015-09-13T23:00:41","moshi","",[],"<p>Oh, that's a good example! Thank you!</p>"],[1,2414649,0,4,0,4,"2015-09-13T22:56:47","BustyChicksFTW","",[],"<p>Doubt it will be answered just by fear of reprisal from the Voat community.</p>"],[2,2414675,2414649,0,0,0,"2015-09-13T22:58:28","moshi","",[],"<p>Yeah. Figured I could at least try. And maybe non-SJWs can discuss things instead. </p>\n<p>Feel free to PM me instead, anyone, if you wanna.</p>"],[1,2418837,0,3,0,3,"2015-09-14T03:31:20","Original_Username","",[],"<p>I was at my cities slutwalk planning committee a few years ago because I saw a flyer and it sounded interesting and I wanted some more information about the movement, I was initially slightly skeptical about the idea but I wanted to know more information about it.</p>\n<p>I don't remember what was said but I remember sitting around this table leaning back and just thinking &quot;WTF&quot; that was the point I realised that these people had drunk the kool aid and weren't interested in the real world.</p>"],[1,2421752,0,1,0,1,"2015-09-14T07:14:16","smashinglyAwesome","",[],"<p>i dont want to be a fascist.</p>"],[1,2422867,0,1,0,1,"2015-09-14T09:35:44","dasfiend","",[],"<p>I guess I'm officially old because I don't know what an SJW is. Oh well.</p>"],[2,2427203,2422867,0,0,0,"2015-09-14T18:29:33","moshi","",[],"<p>Nah, it's good. I think at one point or another we all need to look at Urban Dictionary. :P</p>"]]
